OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest as one woman dies
OL,4,Aand second injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne woman has died and a second woman
OL,7,Fhas been critically injured after being
OL,8,Fattacked at a house in Bradford.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to Carr Bottom Road, in
OL,12,FLittle Horton, at about 01:40 GMT
OL,13,Ffollowing reports of a serious assault.
OL,15,FThe force said a 46-year-old woman was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene, while a
OL,17,F20-year-old woman was taken to hospital
OL,18,Ffor treatment.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
