OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest as one woman dies
OL,4,Aand second injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 27-year-old man was subsequently
OL,7,Farrested elsewhere in the city on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of murder and attempted
OL,9,Fmurder. Police have said they are not
OL,10,Flooking for anyone else in connection
OL,11,Fwith the incident.
